id=apatch_chroot
name=APatch Chroot
version=v0.2.0
versionCode=3
author=Developer-lfierro743
description=Run Linux containers on Android via a privileged daemon that bypasses the app seccomp filter. Docker Hub pull, private-namespace mounts (host audio stays intact), PTY shells. v0.2.0: mini-systemd container init (PID-1 supervisor with --init), systemctl hijack (Ubuntu service commands work), host-side 'service' command, optional box64 (per-container x86_64 via --box64), exec/clone/push/pull, atomic watchdog lock, socket-fallback client.
sourceRepo=https://github.com/Developer-lfierro743/apatch-chroot
